WEBVTT

00:29:29.392 --> 00:29:31.548
either of a candidate or of a company,

00:29:31.572 --> 00:29:32.967
if you are the candidate.

00:29:32.991 --> 00:29:36.016
AG: Richard Sheridan
is the CEO of Menlo Innovations,

00:29:36.040 --> 00:29:38.410
a software design and development firm.

00:29:38.735 --> 00:29:40.889
When he was working at a previous company,

00:29:40.913 --> 00:29:42.087
Rich started to think

00:29:42.111 --> 00:29:44.786
the traditional interview
process was flawed.

00:29:44.810 --> 00:29:46.024
RS: I started to realize

00:29:46.048 --> 00:29:47.968
that there were some fundamental things

00:29:47.992 --> 00:29:51.793
that were recurring nightmares
for me as a hiring manager.

00:29:52.174 --> 00:29:53.567
AG: It was the dotcom bubble,

00:29:53.591 --> 00:29:56.575
and Rich was supposed to hire
a big new team, fast.

00:29:56.599 --> 00:29:59.004
RS: My job was to get
a new hire productive

00:29:59.028 --> 00:30:00.907
before I demoralized them.